  "aiContextParagraph": "Leaders from China, the United States, and Russia gathered in Shenzhen for a historic trilateral summit during the APEC event. During the meetings, participants engaged in discussions regarding global nuclear weapon policy and international diplomacy. Donald Trump characterized his interaction with Vladimir Putin as friendly, while Xi Jinping reportedly facilitated the arrangements for the visiting heads of state. The leaders successfully concluded their summit by issuing a joint peace declaration. This document outlines a shared commitment to reforming the United Nations, increasing supplies of refined petroleum products, and maintaining the immunity currently held by officials within international courts. Observers noted specific moments during the proceedings, including a video recording that appeared to show the United States president with his eyes closed while the Chinese leader delivered a speech to the delegation.",
